ion (parses the board, lists chains, liberties, empty regions, and the whole chain after one player-named candidate move with captures), a `play` wrapper that relays the chosen move, a replay validator, note-keeping and file writes (game-126.md, SGF, AGENTS.md), and a conditional-point list the player edited by hand. Nothing looped over empty points to score moves or played continuations forward, so it only analysed named moves and records.", "stop": false}}